### 图书管理系统 API 测试文件
### 使用方法：在 VS Code 中安装 REST Client 扩展，然后点击 "Send Request" 按钮

### 1. 获取所有图书
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books

###

### 2. 创建新图书
POST http://localhost:3000/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "测试图书",
  "author": "测试作者",
  "isbn": "978-7-111-11111-1",
  "publisher": "测试出版社",
  "publishDate": "2023-01-01",
  "category": "fiction",
  "tags": ["测试", "API"],
  "status": "unread",
  "rating": 3,
  "notes": "这是通过API测试创建的图书",
  "startDate": "",
  "finishDate": "",
  "coverImage": "https://example.com/book-cover.jpg"
}

###

### 3. 获取单本图书 (需要先创建图书获取ID)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books/BOOK_ID_HERE

###

### 4. 更新图书 (需要先创建图书获取ID)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/books/BOOK_ID_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "更新后的图书标题",
  "author": "更新后的作者",
  "rating": 5,
  "notes": "这是通过API测试更新的图书"
}

###

### 5. 搜索图书
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books/search/测试

###

### 6. 按分类获取图书
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books/category/fiction

###

### 7. 按状态获取图书
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books/status/read

###

### 8. 按评分范围获取图书
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books/rating-range?minRating=3&maxRating=5

###

### 9. 获取统计信息
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books/statistics/summary

###

### 10. 删除图书 (需要先创建图书获取ID)
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/books/BOOK_ID_HERE

###